## 3. TECH STACK (do not substitute)

| Tool | Role | Why this one |
|---|---|---|
| Next.js 14 (App Router) | Framework — pages + API in one project | Industry standard, full-stack, Vercel-native |
| TypeScript | Adds types to JavaScript | Catches bugs early |
| Tailwind CSS | Utility classes for styling | Fast, no separate CSS files |
| shadcn/ui | Pre-built React components | Copy-paste, fully owned by us |
| Clerk | Authentication (login, signup, sessions) | SOC 2 compliant, free tier, drop-in |
| Prisma | PostgreSQL ORM with TS safety | Industry standard, great DX |
| PostgreSQL on Railway | App database | Reliable, generous free tier |
| @google-cloud/bigquery | Reads BigQuery | Official Google library |
| Resend | Invitation emails | Free tier, clean API |
| Vercel | Hosting | Free tier, auto-deploys from GitHub |
| GitHub | Code storage | Industry standard |
| Cursor | AI-powered editor | Built on VSCode |

